  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The target audience is individuals who may find offensive or degrading content humorous, particularly those who are familiar with or have encountered chemotherapy patients and may hold harmful stereotypes about their vulnerability. The meme is designed to shock or provoke through vulgar humor, targeting those who might be desensitized to the suffering of cancer patients or who may view them through a lens of exploitation. The audience likely includes people who are not directly affected by cancer but may consume internet memes that normalize harmful and exploitative attitudes toward vulnerable individuals. The meme's intent is to appeal to a community that finds dark, taboo, or transgressive humor amusing, even when it involves the degradation of a specific group (chemotherapy patients).",
